function\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d [mun]s \/ \d+\.\d [mun]s f
.    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 1\) / \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 1\) 
.    cond\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d [mun]s / \d+\.\d [mun]s 
.    .    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 0\) / \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 1\) 
.    .    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 1\) / \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 0\) 
.    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 1\) / \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 1\) 

function\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d [mun]s / \d+\.\d [mun]s f
.    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 1\) / \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 1\) 

function\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d [mun]s / \d+\.\d [mun]s f
.    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 1\) / \d+\.\d [mun]s \(x 1\) 

